+1. `SPEC.hex-loop`: from the exact loop head and exact
+   `Return(Name("count")) .Stmts ~> #endcall` continuation, update `count`
+   from `ACC` to `ACC +Int hexCount(CS)` while allowing `digit` to hold the
+   loop's final character.
